WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
A ticket has separate targets for first response and resolution.

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:07.090
Open its workspace and find SLA Tracking.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:11.800
Read the first response line to see whether that milestone is complete or still due.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.590
Then read the resolution target independently.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:19.460
Responding to the reporter can satisfy the first milestone without completing the repair.

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:23.270
Use the dates and remaining time rather than relying on color alone.
